   "v": "The rate of extinction continues"
  },
  {
   "t": "p",
   "v": "By 2021, 104 endemic Australian species were listed as extinct. In the past 20 years, the number of threatened species and ecosystems has grown by more than one-third. Climate change threatens to increase the rate of losses up to fivefold."
  },
